d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/a85c4e75919df23abcb559aa7668a240.mp4?t=1764222301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies along the way and resources needed to conquer the dungeon will be incorporated into the slot draw as &quot;symbols&quot;.<br>Symbols can be obtained by stepping on each floor or by various effects in the floor. <br>The symbols are obtained when players step on each floor or by various effects in the dungeon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type of Symbols&quot;</strong><br><strong>Spell</strong>: Triggered after the slot is drawn, these have various effects on the floor. <br><strong>Items</strong>: Placed on floor tiles, these activate when picked up or approached. <br><strong>Enemies</strong>: These adversaries are out to get you. Study their characteristics and find the key to defeating them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/b2560af2a982e23d1186e2597c86301d.poster.avif?t=1764222301\" width=630 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/b2560af2a982e23d1186e2597c86301d.webm?t=1764222301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/b2560af2a982e23d1186e2597c86301d.mp4?t=1764222301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slot &amp; Dungeons, you choose one of several characters to take on the dungeon challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique abilities and symbols, such as <strong>the Warrior</strong>, who excels at melee attacks and high durability, and <strong>the Mage</strong>, who speciali